          "text": "ሎ ዘኮነ ፤⟫ ሠላሳ ሶስት ዓመት",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 28,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "የሚደረገውን ታምራት ሳያዩ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
